  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing entrepreneurship in the creative sector of Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at supporting the Moroccan federation for Cultural and Creative industries and relevant (local) decision makers by investigating and raising awareness on the role of legislation and in showcasing local initiatives in the Netherlands as an inspiring example to Moroccan colleagues in the public sector.This should contribute to the ultimate goal of creating more possibilities to earn a fair living in the creative sector in Morocco.</narrative>
  </description>
